        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 50 · AI Business Insights Dashboard\nDaily combines sales, marketing, support and finance metrics into an AI-written insights digest and logs KPIs for a dashboard.\n\n**Trigger:** schedule `0 7 * * *`\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate."
      }
